  {
    "id": 1014005040110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え、本当？\r\n甘奈、合格？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101400504/1014005040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ！　これから一緒にがんばっていこう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014005040120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "やったぁ\r\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いしまーす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400504/1014005040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、よろしくな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それと大崎さん\r\nひとつ宿題を出してもいいかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014005040130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！\r\nなになに～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400504/1014005040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『大崎さん個人としてアイドルになってやりたいこと』\r\nについて考えてみてほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014005040140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……それって？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400504/1014005040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大崎さんはお姉さんと仲がいいし\r\n一緒に輝きたいっていう理由もすごくいいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、すごくしっかりしているし\r\n俺の見る限り人を惹きつける力も感じるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014005040150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがと！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400504/1014005040150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、自分の芯というか\r\nそういう部分を見つめてみてほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "活動していく中で見つかる人もいるから\r\nすぐに答えを教えてほしいとは言わないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと大崎さんの武器になると思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
